---
// endlesscustomers.com/coaching: Get Coaching & Training. An endlesscustomers.com page (not a hop),
// and the clearest handoff on either site: IMPACT is the company that delivers coaching. Book a
// call right here, or go to IMPACT's coaching section for the detail.
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
import { href, asset } from '../../lib/site';
---

<Site site="ec" title="Get Coaching & Training" path="/coaching" description="Coaching and training that installs the Endless Customers system with your team, delivered by IMPACT, the company behind the system.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href={href('ec', '/coaching')}>Coaching</a><span>&gt;</span><span class="here">Get Coaching &amp; Training</span></p>
      <h1>Coaching and training that installs the system with your team.</h1>
      <p class="lede">A certified Endless Customers coach works with your leadership, sales, and marketing teams until the system runs without them. Coaching is delivered by <b>IMPACT</b>, the company behind Endless Customers, and by certified independent coaches.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn grad" href={href('ec', '/book-a-call')}>Book a Free Call</a>
        <a class="btn" href={href('impact', '/coaching')}>IMPACT’s coaching services, in detail ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section who">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="handoff">
        <img src={asset('img/people/bob-ruffolo.jpg')} alt="" width="56" height="56" />
        <div>
          <h2>Who delivers it</h2>
          <p>IMPACT built the Endless Customers system with Marcus Sheridan, runs the conference and the coaching program, and certifies independent coaches. When you book a call on this page, you’re talking to IMPACT. The full coaching section, with how it works, pricing, and results, is on impactplus.com; the short version is below.</p>
          <a href={href('impact', '/about')}>About IMPACT ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What working with a coach looks like</h2>
      <div class="grid c4">
        <div class="card"><h3>Alignment Day</h3><p>Leadership, sales, and marketing in one room. Everyone understands the system and their role.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>A 90-day plan</h3><p>Benchmark where you are, set priorities, reset every quarter.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Weekly coaching</h3><p>Content and video, website, assignment selling, HubSpot, practical AI. In your business, not a classroom.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><h3>Mastery</h3><p>Your team runs it. Coaching gets lighter or ends.</p></div>
      </div>
      <a class="more" href={href('impact', '/coaching/how-it-works')}>How it works, in detail, on impactplus.com ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2>What it costs</h2>
          <p class="intro">Coaching starts with the Deep Diagnostic &amp; Roadmap ($5,000) and an Alignment Day, then runs month to month by plan. The full implementation also costs people, video, a website that can carry it, and HubSpot; the pricing page here lays out the total, with and without a coach.</p>
          <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 8px;">
            <a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/pricing')}>Total cost of implementing the system</a>
            <a class="btn" href={href('impact', '/coaching/pricing')}>Coaching plans and prices ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="prices">
          <li><span>Deep Diagnostic &amp; Roadmap</span><b>$5,000</b></li>
          <li><span>Alignment Day</span><b>from $10,000</b></li>
          <li><span>Coaching, monthly</span><b>$5,500 to $10,500</b></li>
          <li class="note">Live-site figures, to verify for 2027. Every call, training, and deliverable is covered by IMPACT’s 100% money-back guarantee.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Who the coaches are</h2>
      <p class="intro">Every certified Endless Customers coach, IMPACT’s own and independent, is in one directory here. Who they are, what they’ve done, and which industries they know.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/coaches')}>Meet the coaches <span class="arrow">→</span></a><a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/become-a-coach')}>Become a coach</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Results</h2>
      <div class="grid c3">
        <blockquote class="quote"><p>“For the most part, all of our new prospects are chasing us. They’re finding us online. They’re finding us on YouTube.”</p><footer>Brian Paulson, Owner, CSI Accounting and Payroll</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="quote"><p>“IMPACT has completely changed our company. We would not be here without me picking up that book.”</p><footer>Taffy Ragan, Co-Owner, Bill Ragan Roofing</footer></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="quote"><p>“Every single call with my coach, I’m challenged with a new approach, a new method, a new way to handle the problems we’re facing.”</p><footer>Isabelle Braeutigam, Marketing Manager, Custom Built Design &amp; Remodeling</footer></blockquote>
      </div>
      <a class="more" href={href('ec', '/success-stories')}>All success stories →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Not sure coaching is the right way?</h2>
      <p class="intro">There are three ways to implement the system: on your own, with the Academy, or with a coach. The How to Implement page lays them out honestly, including who shouldn’t hire a coach.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/how-to-implement')}>How to implement <span class="arrow">→</span></a><a class="btn" href={href('ec', '/instant-diagnostic')}>Free instant AI diagnostic</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section final">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Talk to someone who has done this with hundreds of companies.</h2>
      <p class="intro">Thirty minutes with IMPACT about your business, what’s in the way, and whether the Deep Diagnostic is the right first step.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn grad" href={href('ec', '/book-a-call')}>Book a Free Call</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section connects">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>How this page connects</h2>
      <p class="src">impactplus.com is the source for coaching; this page is the door. Both sites say the same thing about what coaching is and what it costs.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><span>The full coaching section: how it works, plans, results, Alignment Day</span><a href={href('impact', '/coaching')}>impactplus.com/coaching ↗ →</a></li>
        <li><span>The coach directory is here, and IMPACT links to it rather than duplicating it</span><a href={href('ec', '/coaches')}>Our coaches →</a></li>
        <li><span>The same booking on the IMPACT side</span><a href={href('impact', '/talk')}>impactplus.com/talk ↗ →</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 72px 0 56px; }
  .crumbs .here { color: var(--ink); }
  .lede b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .who { padding: 40px 0; }
  .handoff { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 28px 32px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--bg-panel); }
  .handoff img { width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; }
  .handoff h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; }
  .handoff p { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 15px; max-width: 70ch; }
  .handoff a { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .section > .wrap > a.more { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: start; }
  .prices { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .prices li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 16px; }
  .prices b { font-weight: 600; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .prices .note { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); border: 0; }
  .quote { margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 18px; border-left: 2px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .quote p { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .quote footer { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .final { padding-bottom: 72px; }
  .connects { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg-panel); }
  .connects h2 { font-size: 20px; }
  .connects .src { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 15px; }
  .connects ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; max-width: 800px; }
  .connects li { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px 24px; padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .connects li a { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; } .handoff { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .handoff img { display: none; } .hero { padding: 48px 0 36px; } }
</style>
